        "can_wiki": false,
        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "It works with Lost in the Past (thanks grysqrl). If that card is out, and there are no cards in the trash, you lose. Since it is actually really hard for the trash to run out, there isn't much of a point to discard a card.\r\n\r\nAlso, Haka only draws a card when they are destroyed not discarded.",
