        "raw": "<p>Lost in the Past causes you to lose if there are no cards in the environment trash. This gives you another way to get a card into that trash. It is also useful if you know something nasty is on top of the environment deck and want to get rid of it.</p><p>Edit: I guess you could use also use it to accelerate an Akash&#39;Bhuta flip. So, there are a few very specific cases where this is useful, but most of the time people probably don&#39;t discard for it.</p>",
